        "name": "USN-8344-3",
        "description": "USN-8344-1 introduced a regression in pip. This update provides a complete fix for this issue..  We apologize for the inconvenience.  Original advisory details:   It was discovered that pip's bundled urllib3 library improperly  handled streaming decompression of highly compressed data. A remote  attacker could possibly use this issue to cause pip to consume excessive resources,  leading to a denial of service. (CVE-2025-66471)",
        "aliases": [
          "CVE-2025-66471"
        ]
